        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Great men are not always wise: neither do the aged understand judgment.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 24
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:9",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore I said, Hearken to me; I also will shew mine opinion.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:10",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I waited for your words; I gave ear to your reasons, whilst ye searched out what to say.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:11",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, I attended unto you, and, behold, there was none of you that convinced Job, or that answered his words:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 48
          },
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 83
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:12",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Lest ye should say, We have found out wisdom: God thrusteth him down, not man.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:13",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Now he hath not directed his words against me: neither will I answer him with your speeches.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 28
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:14",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "They were amazed, they answered no more: they left off speaking.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:15",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "When I had waited, (for they spake not, but stood still, and answered no more;)",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 60
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:16",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "I said, I will answer also my part, I also will shew mine opinion.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:17",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "For I am full of matter, the spirit within me constraineth me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:18",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, my belly is as wine which hath no vent; it is ready to burst like new bottles.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 78,
            "end": 85,
            "text": "HEB wineskins."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 19
          },
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 33
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:19",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "I will speak, that I may be refreshed: I will open my lips and answer.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:20",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Let me not, I pray you, accept any man’s person, neither let me give flattering titles unto man.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 32:21",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "For I know not to give flattering titles; in so doing my maker would soon take me away.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "TG Flatter."
          }
        ],
